Interactability_Text_Line_2 Emergency Landing End in Worse Emergency
Interactability_Text_Line_3 Authorities are diverting all flights away from Galeão International after airport reportedly got overrun by infected arriving by plane after an emergency landing at the airport. Situation reported by local police as 'under control' despite reported riots in neighboring town to airport.